  ('foundation:EmploymentContract', 'rdfs:comment', NULL, 'An employment record linking a person to a company, with contract dates, contract type, work relationship, salary, and benefits', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 101, 0, 0),
  ('foundation:EmploymentContract', 'rdfs:label', NULL, 'Contrato de Trabalho', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 101, 0, 0),
  ('foundation:EmploymentContract', 'rdfs:seeAlso', NULL, '
Represents a formal employment relationship between a person and a company.
This is the central concept that links together:
- The employee (Person)
- The employer (Company)
- The job occupation
- Salary history
- Contract details

Cardinality constraints:
- employer: exactly 1 (required - must have exactly one employer)
- admissionDate: exactly 1 (required - admission date is mandatory)
- occupation: exactly 1 (required - must have exactly one job occupation)
- terminationDate: 0-1 (at most one termination date)
- contractType: 0-1 (one contract type: CLT, PJ, etc.)
- workRelationship: 0-1 (one work relationship type)
- initialSalary: 0-1 (one initial salary value)
- lastSalary: 0-1 (one last salary value)
- contractualSalary: 0-1 (one current contractual salary)

Example:
  :johnEmployment a foundation:EmploymentContract ;
      foundation:hasEmploymentContract :john ;
      foundation:employer :acmeCompany ;
      foundation:occupation :softwareEngineerJob ;
      foundation:admissionDate "2020-01-15"^^xsd:date ;
      foundation:terminationDate "2023-06-30"^^xsd:date ;
      foundation:contractType "CLT" ;
      foundation:workRelationship "Full-time" ;
      foundation:initialSalary "5000.00"^^xsd:decimal ;
      foundation:lastSalary "7500.00"^^xsd:decimal ;
      foundation:contractualSalary "7500.00"^^xsd:decimal ;
      foundation:observations "Registro na CTPS nº 123" .
', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 134, 0, 0),
