  ('foundation:FinancialTransaction', 'rdfs:seeAlso', NULL, '
Base class for all types of financial transactions.

Subtypes:
- BankTransfer (between bank accounts)
- Payment (for goods/services)
- Invoice (bill for payment)
- Expense (expenditure record)
- Income (revenue record)

Cardinality constraints:
- transactionDate: exactly 1 (required)
- transactionAmount: exactly 1 (required)
- transactionCurrency: exactly 1 (required)
- transactionId: max 1 (optional)
- transactionStatus: max 1 (optional)
- transactionDescription: max 1 (optional)
- transactionFee: max 1 (optional)
', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 139, 0, 0),
