  ('foundation:SoftwareFeature', 'foundation:aiBehaviorRules', NULL, 'Before creating a new SoftwareFeature, sample 3-5 existing instances to understand the established pattern (properties used, relationships, naming). Match that pattern exactly.

Before creating a SoftwareFeature, always check if the scope fits better as a UserStory inside an existing feature. A feature is a broad, named capability (max 3 words, noun-based). A user story is a specific user need. If an existing feature already covers the domain, create a UserStory inside it — not a new feature.', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 101, 0, 0),
