  ('foundation:hasFile', 'rdfs:seeAlso', NULL, '
Generic property to link any digital thing to its file attachments.

This property is defined at the DigitalThing level, making it available to all subclasses:
- IdentificationDocument (CNH, RG, Passport) - PDF scans, photos
- Invoice (including BrazilianNFSe) - PDF invoices
- Contract - signed PDFs
- File - file representations
- Any other digitally represented entity

Examples:
  :myCNH foundation:hasFile :cnhPDFFile .
  :myNFSe foundation:hasFile :nfsePDF .
  :myContract foundation:hasFile :signedContractPDF .

  :cnhPDFFile a foundation:File ;
      foundation:fileName "cnh-digital.pdf" ;
      foundation:hasFileType foundation:FileType_PDF .
', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 131, 0, 0),
