Property lookup (reads a property from the entity stored under a context key):
- {{inputIRIs.rdfs:label}} — label of the triggering entity
- {{inputIRIs.foundation:someProperty}} — full IRI property
- {{inputIRIs.someProperty}} — bare name, automatically prefixed with foundation:
- {{outputIRIs.rdfs:label}} — label of the output entity

