  ('http://www.linkedmodel.org/schema/dtype#defaultValue', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, 'The property "dtype:defaultValue" is a general property for specifying a value in situations where none is specified, or can be determined. In some cases of use, this property could have a scalar value and in other cases may need to refer to a first class concept that holds a "value object".  For this reason, the  type of this property is set as "rdf:Property" and the property is rangeless.', 'xsd:string', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 102, 0, 0),
