  ('qudt:udunitsCode', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, 'The UDUNITS package supports units of physical quantities. Its C library provides for arithmetic manipulation of units and for conversion of numeric values between compatible units. The package contains an extensive unit database, which is in XML format and user-extendable. The package also contains a command-line utility for investigating units and converting values.', 'rdf:HTML', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 201, 0, 0),
