  ('unit:ANGSTROM3', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, 'A unit that is a non-SI unit, specifically a CGS unit,  of polarizability known informally as polarizability volume.  The SI defined units for polarizability are C*m^2/V and can be converted to $Angstr\ddot{o}m$^3 by multiplying the SI value by 4 times pi times the vacuum permittivity and then converting the resulting m^3 to $Angstr\ddot{o}m$^3 through the SI base 10 conversion (multiplying by 10^-30).', 'qudt:LatexString', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 202, 0, 0),
