  ('unit:C_Stat-PER-CentiM2', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, '$\textit{Statcoulomb per Square Centimeter}$ is a unit of measure for electric flux density and electric polarization. 
  One Statcoulomb per Square Centimeter is $2.15\times 10^9 \, coulomb\,per\,square\,inch$.
