  ('unit:M-PER-MIN', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, 'Meter Per Minute (m/min) is a unit in the category of Velocity. It is also known as meter/minute, meters per minute, metre per minute, metres per minute. Meter Per Minute (m/min) has a dimension of LT-1 where $L$ is length, and $T$ is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit m/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.016666666666', 'rdf:HTML', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 202, 0, 0),
