  ('unit:PA-SEC-PER-M3', 'http://purl.org/dc/terms/description', NULL, '$\textit{Pascal Second Per Cubic Meter}$ ($Pa-s/m^3$) is a unit in the category of Acoustic impedance. It is also known as $\textit{pascal-second/cubic meter}$. It has a dimension of $ML^{-4}T^{-1}$ where $M$ is mass, $L$ is length, and $T$ is time. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.', 'qudt:LatexString', NULL, 'literal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 202, 0, 0),
